[4;35mNAME[0m                                    

greet - print a friendly greeting       

[4;35mSYNOPSIS[0m                                

[1mgreet [0m[[1m-n [0m[3mcount[0m] [[1m--shout[0m] [3mname[0m...      

[4;35mDESCRIPTION[0m                             

[1mgreet [0mwrites a greeting for each [3mname [0mto
standard output. The greeting is “Hello”
unless [1m--shout [0msays otherwise — then it 
is louder.                              

[1;35mOptions[0m                                 

[1m-n[0m[1m, [0m[1m--count[0m[1m=[0m[1;3mN[0m
    Repeat each greeting [3mN [0mtimes.       

[1m-s[0m[1m, [0m[1m--shout[0m
    Write the greeting in capitals.     
                                        
        [1m • [0mWorks with every name.       
        [1m • [0mIgnores the locale.          

